  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">允許設定哪些箭矢適用於無限附魔</h1><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe style=\"width:580px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/N_B1uy8i8W8?wmode=transparent\" width=\"580\" height=\"339\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/most-arrows-infinity-fix/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/模組加載器-Forge-1E2D42\" alt=\"\" width=\"116\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/most-arrows-infinity-fix/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20&amp;gameVersionTypeId=6\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/模組加載器-NeoForge-D7742F\" alt=\"\" width=\"138\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/most-arrows-infinity-fix/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20&amp;gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/模組加載器-Fabric-BCB29C\" alt=\"\" width=\"118\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/most-arrows-infinity-fix/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20&amp;gameVersionTypeId=5\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/模組加載器-Quilt-DC29DD\" alt=\"\" width=\"110\" height=\"20\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/most-arrows-infinity-fix/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=1738749986:70886\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/版本-1.16.x-ff5900\" alt=\"\" width=\"118\" height=\"23\"></a> <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/most-arrows-infinity-fix/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=1738749986:73242\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/版本-1.17.x-ff5900\" alt=\"\" width=\"118\" height=\"23\"></a> <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/most-arrows-infinity-fix/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=1738749986:73250\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/版本-1.18.x-ff5900\" alt=\"\" width=\"118\" height=\"23\"></a> <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/most-arrows-infinity-fix/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=1738749986:73407\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/版本-1.19.x-ff5900\" alt=\"\" width=\"118\" height=\"23\"></a> <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/most-arrows-infinity-fix/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=1738749986:75125\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/版本-1.20.x-ff5900\" alt=\"\" width=\"118\" height=\"23\"></a> <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/most-arrows-infinity-fix/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=1738749986:77784\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/版本-1.21.x-ff5900\" alt=\"\" width=\"118\" height=\"23\"></a></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>功能特色：</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">可設定禁用特定箭矢的無限附魔效果（包含各種藥水箭變體）。未列入此設定的所有箭矢將強制適用無限附魔。</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">為不想手動調整平衡性的玩家提供可選預設方案。</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">包含<strong>所有箭矢無限修復</strong>模組的全部功能。</span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>設定說明：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">設定包含兩個黑名單。</span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>箭矢黑名單：</strong>&nbsp;列入此清單的箭矢將無法使用無限附魔。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>藥水黑名單：</strong> 此清單將阻止特定類型的藥水箭適用無限附魔。</span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">本模組<strong>不應</strong>與「所有箭矢無限修復」模組同時使用，請根據需求擇一安裝。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>模組包政策：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;歡迎將本模組收錄於任何發佈在CurseForge上的模組包。本模組的開發初衷即為方便模組包創作者使用。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;<strong>支持模組開發：透過專屬優惠碼選購超值商品。點擊下方連結，結帳時輸入代碼「JACKBUSTERS」即可享75折優惠。</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fjackbusters%253fr%253dMost-Arrows-Infinity-Fix\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/ba99da02-fd57-4ccc-89a5-9a5bba0922d2.webp\" width=\"900\" height=\"150\"></strong></a></span></p>",
